   <standOff><listPerson><person xml:id="person3714"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">vimalamitra</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dri ma med pa'i bshes gnyen</persName><birth notBefore="0700-01-01">after 700</birth><sex value="M"/><nationality>Indic</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P5011</idno><idno type="APIS">3714</idno></person><person xml:id="person3818"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bya 'dul 'dzin brtson 'grus 'bar</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">བྱ་འདུལ་འཛིན་བརྩོན་འགྲུས་འབར</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bya 'dul 'dzin</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bya 'dul brtson 'grus 'bar</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bya 'du ba 'dzin ba brtson 'grus 'bar</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dge bshes zul phu ba</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sangs rgyas bya 'dul 'dzin brtson 'grus 'bar</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zul bya 'dul ba 'dzin pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zul phul bya 'dul ba 'dzin pa chen po</persName><birth notBefore="1091-01-01" notAfter="1100-12-31">after 1091 before 1100</birth><death notBefore="1147-01-01" notAfter="1174-12-31">after 1147 before 1174</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P2273</idno><idno type="APIS">3818</idno><note type="comment">Born in 1091 at gTsang rong gyung and died at the age of 76 in Zul phu according to [R894SIKE]: 109.&#13;
[W4T5ZMUP]: 38 accordingly proposes the dates 1091-1166.&#13;
[VKBZTBWN], fol. 3b6 reports that he was born the year rNgog lo (ID:3786) came back to Tibet, i.e., ca. 1092.&#13;
On his life, based on the Zul phu mkhan byang chub rin chen dpal bzang po'i rnam par thar pa (ID:6715), see [W4T5ZMUP]: 40.&#13;
It is unclear whether he is the same person as rGya 'dul ba 'dzin pa (ID:4193). The [NA9AMDH6] distinguishes two "rGya 'dul 'dzin" - the elder (ID: 3941) and the younger (ID:4193) - and a "Bya 'dul 'dzin brTson 'grus 'bar" (student of 'Bre chen po). In contrast, the [R894SIKE] only mentions one "rGya 'dul 'dzin" (the elder), distinct from "Bya 'dul 'dzin" (who was ordained by 'Bre).&#13;
[VKBZTBWN], fol. 6b5-6 and [8VLVHDR2], fol. 14b5 report that he was ordained by 'Bre and received from him the name in religion brTson 'grus 'bar.&#13;
A number of the same teachers are mentioned for rGya 'dul 'dzin the younger and Bya 'dul 'dzin but, for instance, the latter's studies with rGya 'dul 'dzin the older took place when he was a retired abbot, whereas the former's studies with him took place when he was still abbot.&#13;
Further, rGya 'dul 'dzin the younger became abbot of dGa' ba sdong and Bya 'dul abbot of Zul phu.&#13;
This suggests they might have been distinct persons.</note></person><person xml:id="person3941"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rgya 'dul 'dzin dbang phyug tshul khrims</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">རྒྱ་འདུལ་འཛིན་དབང་ཕྱུག་ཚུལ་ཁྲིམས</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rgya dbang phyug tshul khrims 'bar</persName><birth notBefore="1047-01-01" notAfter="1047-12-31">1047</birth><death notBefore="1131-01-01" notAfter="1131-12-31">1131</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P3063</idno><idno type="APIS">3941</idno><note type="comment">Native of Nyang stod Mang ra ba (or Mang rab) born in sTag gi rGya ma ra ba in the vicinity of rBa brCad, known as "rGya 'Dul 'dzin the elder" to distinguish him from "rGya 'Dul 'dzin the younger" (ID:4193). See [647FFPZR]: 541. See also [UGZJBIWM]: 376.&#13;
&#13;
Disciple of Zhang zhung pa rGyal ba'i shes rab and Ye shes&#13;
bla ma in sTod, gZhon tshul in 'Dzims and 'Brom Seng dkar in dBus. His disciples include sTon pa Yang rab from Glo bo, the elder and younger Brag ston in western gTsang, the elder Leng and the younger 'Brog, and 'Gar (=Rong pa 'Gar dGe ba gsal), 'Gos (=rje 'Gos) and Yol (=Yol Chos dbang) ([Q922IUFM]: 1: 98).</note></person><person xml:id="person3959"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rin chen skyabs</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">རིན་ཆེན་སྐྱབས</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">shAkya dge slong rin chen skyabs</persName><birth notBefore="1020-01-01" notAfter="1121-12-31">after 1020 before 1121</birth><death notBefore="1101-01-01" notAfter="1200-12-31">after 1101 before 1200</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P3JT13443</idno><idno type="APIS">3959</idno></person><person xml:id="person3961"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mtha' bzhi brtson 'grus 'bar</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">མཐའ་བཞི་བརྩོན་འགྲུས་འབར</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">3961</idno><note type="comment">One of the "four pillars" (ka ba bzhi) of rGya 'dul 'dzin (ID:3941).</note></person></listPerson><listBibl><bibl xml:id="work4682"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'dul TIka 'thad ldan</title><title xml:lang="bo">འདུལ་ཊཱིཀ་འཐད་ལྡན</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bya 'dul 'dzin brtson 'grus 'bar gyis mdzad pa'i 'dul TIka 'thad ldan</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bya 'dul ba 'dzin pa chen pos mdzad pa'i 'dul Tik 'thad ldan zhes bya ba</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notAfter="1174-12-31">ater 1100 before 1174</date><author ref="person:3818">bya 'dul 'dzin brtson 'grus 'bar</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Instruction on monastic discipline ('dul ba), parts of which are considered distinct texts in some instances:&#13;
1) dge slong gi rnam par 'byed pa gtan la dbab pa - in (ID:4681), fols. 1-100a7; (ID:8092), fols. 1-86a7.&#13;
2) dge slong ma'i rnam par 'byed pa'i ti ka 'thad ldan - in (ID:8092), fols. 87-113a8; no equivalent in (ID:4681).&#13;
3) spyir bstan rnam par 'byed pa'i ti ka 'thad ldan - in (ID:4681), fols. 100a8-135b1; partially (the end) in (ID:8098), fols. 150-182a3; almost complete (only the first folio is missing) in (ID:8097), fols. 2-29b4.&#13;
4) bzhi bcu drug gi dam bsal bar bston pa'i ti ka 'thad ldan - in (ID:4681), fols. 135b1-185a3; (ID:4683), fols. +1-+44a7; (ID:8096), fols. 16a-42b6; incomplete (end missing) in (ID:8098), fols. 183a-225b.&#13;
&#13;
This could be the work listed as "'dul Tik" by A khu ching shes rab rgya mtsho in his Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 536, No. 11708: bya 'dul 'dzin brtson 'grus 'bar gyi 'dul Tik dang 'dul ba'i spyi don).</note><idno type="APIS">4682</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work4696"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">ti ka 'thad ldan gyi 'grel pa rin chen rgyan 'bum</title><title xml:lang="bo">ཏི་ཀ་འཐད་ལྡན་གྱི་འགྲེལ་པ་རིན་ཆེན་རྒྱན་འབུམ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'dul ba mdo rtsa'i 'grel ba lung kun las btus pa zhes bya ba gzhi smad</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'dul ba mdo rtsa'i 'grel pa lung kun las btus pa zhes bya ba gzhi stod</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1100-01-01" notAfter="1240-12-31">after 1100 before 1240</date><author ref="person:3959">rin chen skyabs</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">The colophon echoes the style of Bya 'dul 'dzin's work (ID:4682).&#13;
The author makes numerous references to the views of other scholars but does not name them. Some appear to be identified in annotations on the manuscript, but these are hardly legible, and some of them appear to be numbers rather than names.</note><relatedItem type="commentaryOn" target="work:4682"/><idno type="APIS">4696</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work7386"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">pratimokṣa­sūtra­ṭīkā­vinaya­samuccaya</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">so sor thar pa'i mdo rgya cher 'grel pa 'dul ba kun las btus pa</title><author ref="person:3714">vimalamitra</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">7386</idno></bibl></listBibl><listRelation><relation xml:id="rel201" name="student-of" active="#person3959" passive="#person3818" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel206" name="student-of" active="#person3959" passive="#person3961" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel205" name="student-of" active="#person3959" passive="#person3941" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel701" name="author-of" active="#person3959" passive="#work4696" type="positive"><desc>Evidence: <ptr target="#ex032_01_033_012025-12-0116-00-07"/></desc></relation></listRelation></standOff><text>
